{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34157","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 晓次神景宫 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 晓次神景宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓帆逗碕岸，高步入神景。\n洒洒襟袖清，如临蘂珠屏。\n虽然羣动息，此地常寂静。\n翠镊有寒锵，碧花无定影。\n凭轩羽人傲，夹户天兽猛。\n稽首朝元君，褰衣就虚省。\n呀空雪牙利，嗽水石齿冷。\n香母未垂婴，芝田不论顷。\n遥通河汉口，近抚松桂顶。\n饭荐七白蔬，杯酾九光杏。\n人间附尘躅，固陋真钳颈。\n肯信拚鳌倾，犹疑夏虫永。\n玄津荡琼垄，紫汞啼金鼎。\n尽出冰霜书，期君一披省。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}